# GMS's own ten points, added to what Frailty Curse already takes off the
# attacks hitting the character. The DEF half of GMS's penalty is dropped, as on
# the skill itself: nothing here reads a monster's DEF as a number to lower.
name: "Frailty Curse - Enhance"
description: "Increases the Attack Power penalty from Frailty Curse."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_NIGHT_LORD skill_order: 7 }
hyper: true
required_level: 140
max_level: 1
base { enemy_attack_pct: 0.10 }
